{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SCwRFlN6mm1792740340.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的高級警員朱振國，以警隊最高榮譽喪禮舉殯，靈柩安葬浩園。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1400.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Nj7egGMBKO1792736031.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>最高榮譽喪禮在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，靈堂掛上「浩氣長存」橫幅。行政長官李家超、多名司局長及行會成員、警務處處長周一鳴、前處長李明逵等都有出席喪禮。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1400_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KVRfZPcDxM1792736029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>大殮後，朱振國的靈柩蓋上區旗，移送上由警車改裝的靈車。特首率領官員及警隊代表等，在殯儀館外列隊送別。隨著警察樂隊奏起哀樂，靈車慢慢駛離。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1400_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vCgiDWzvRL1792736026.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>靈柩移送至朱振國生前駐守的長沙灣警署，進行道別儀式。警員在警署內列隊，並向靈車獻上花圈及敬禮。靈柩之後移送和合石浩園，進行安葬儀式。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL-1500_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cZy7UW4hPW1792744821.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警務處處長周一鳴再次率領在場警員，向朱振國敬禮，肅立致哀，家屬亦難掩悲痛。靈柩隨後下葬，同袍在墓前致送花圈。周一鳴與家屬握手表達慰問，全體再逐一上香，作最後道別。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL-1500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026H7guN4y9ib1792744792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>朱振國2005年執勤期間被一名青年拔刀割傷頸部，因大量失血，令腦部缺氧致全身癱瘓。翌年他獲政府頒授金英勇勳章，表揚其英勇行為。朱振國上月中因器官衰竭，在廣華醫院離世，終年52歲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:42.339405+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":425,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:38:18.259556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:49.702175+00:00","content_hash":"89d04652299a0383c94edbecf6d714c681b8b17a07ce78db1bd63c2ca5c3a83f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:42.339405+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}